            "review_title": "Review at Đồng Xuân Quán - Đặc sản Ngan phố cổ",
            "review_text": "Nguyễn Thái Hoà\nHanoi, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nExcellent local food in the Old Quarter\nSep 2026 • Friends\nI had a really enjoyable meal at Đồng Xuân Quán and would definitely recommend it to anyone looking for authentic Vietnamese food in Hanoi.\nI tried the roasted garlic duck, which was the highlight of the meal. The duck was flavorful, tender and had a really nice crispy, aromatic taste from the garlic. The duck noodle soup was also delicious, with a rich and comforting broth. Everything tasted fresh and well prepared.\nThe location is convenient for exploring the Old Quarter, and the atmosphere is casual and welcoming. The staff were friendly and helpful throughout the meal, which made the experience even better.\nA great place to stop for traditional Vietnamese dishes, especially if you want to try something beyond the usual tourist food. I would happily come back and try more dishes next time\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 7, 2026",
